\v 9 [How long wilt thou sleep]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w O sluggard| strong="H6102" \w*? [when wilt thou arise]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w out of thy sleep| strong="H8142" \w*? 
