\p
\v 16 \w These six| strong="H8337" \w* things doth the \sc Lord\sc* [hate]{strong=“H8130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: [yea, seven]{strong=“H7651”} are \w an abomination| strong="H8441" \w* \w unto him| strong="H5315" \w*:\f + \fr 6:16 \ft unto…: Heb. of his soul \f* 
