\p 
\v 1 \w Doth not wisdom| strong="H2451" \w* [cry]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}? \w and understanding| strong="H8394" \w* [put forth]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w her voice| strong="H6963" \w*? 
