\v 4 [Unto you, O men]{strong=“H376”}, [I call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; \w and my voice| strong="H6963" \w* is \w to the sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w of man| strong="H120" \w*. 
