\v 7 \w For my mouth| strong="H2441" \w* [shall speak]{strong=“H1897” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w truth| strong="H571" \w*; \w and wickedness| strong="H7562" \w* is \w an abomination| strong="H8441" \w* \w to my lips| strong="H8193" \w*.\f + \fr 8:7 \ft an…: Heb. the abomination of my lips \f* 
\v 8 \w All the words| strong="H561" \w* \w of my mouth| strong="H6310" \w* are \w in righteousness| strong="H6664" \w*; there is [nothing froward]{strong=“H6617” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w or perverse| strong="H6141" \w* in them.\f + \fr 8:8 \ft froward: Heb. wreathed \f* 
