\v 11 \w For wisdom| strong="H2451" \w* is \w better| strong="H2896" \w* \w than rubies| strong="H6443" \w*; \w and all the things that may be desired| strong="H2656" \w* [are not to be compared]{strong=“H7737” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} to it. 
\p
\v 12 \w I wisdom| strong="H2451" \w* [dwell]{strong=“H7931” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w with prudence| strong="H6195" \w*, [and find out]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w knowledge| strong="H1847" \w* \w of witty inventions| strong="H4209" \w*.\f + \fr 8:12 \ft prudence: or, subtilty \f* 
