\v 14 \w Counsel| strong="H6098" \w* is [mine, and sound wisdom]{strong=“H8454”}: I am \w understanding| strong="H998" \w*; \w I have strength| strong="H1369" \w*. 
\v 15 \w By me kings| strong="H4428" \w* [reign]{strong=“H4427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and princes]{strong=“H7336” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [decree]{strong=“H2710” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8779”} \w justice| strong="H6664" \w*. 
