\c 21
\p 
\v 1 [The king’s]{strong=“H4428”} \w heart| strong="H3820" \w* is \w in the hand| strong="H3027" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, as \w the rivers| strong="H6388" \w* \w of water| strong="H4325" \w*: [he turneth]{strong=“H5186” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [it whithersoever he will]{strong=“H2654” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
