\v 18 \w The wicked| strong="H7563" \w* shall be \w a ransom| strong="H3724" \w* \w for the righteous| strong="H6662" \w*, [and the transgressor]{strong=“H898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w for the upright| strong="H3477" \w*. 
